dance Forerunner
// The bass pushes the morph; the bass brings it nearer; the middle sets how fast it spins and the
// kicks turn it; drops in the hi-hats reverse it.
// Inspired by precursal, a DancerDNA music style.

morph follows music.bass speed 1.58 settle 0.02
zoom follows music.bass amount 0.5 settle 32.5
spin follows music.mid from 252 to 11.5 smooth 0.25
turn on music.bass_hit changes by 0.53
reverse on music.high_hit drops by 0.57 on 6 off 2
